Description: CVE-2026-109618 - Bound memory used by multipart part headers
 Retain only the Content-Disposition/Content-Type multipart part headers
 (ignoring duplicates), so an attacker-controlled number of headers cannot grow
 the header list without bound. This is the rfc1867.c part of the upstream fix;
 the request-startup state resets for the same CVE are in the CVE-2026-109619
 patch of this package.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/01a40e89fbfc499936e3b05888d8f00bfde886df
